{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Build built-in previews from the serialized payload.** Using `originalValue` bypasses the configured `SerDes`: a redacting or encrypting serializer can omit a secret from storage while `INCLUDE_ALL` writes it back into checkpoint preview metadata. Always derive configured previews from `serialized`; reserve `originalValue` for explicitly custom preview generators, and add a redacting-SerDes regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7on8rT","finding_digest":"11487a5e83e2ff1f30557254a639de839eb203f96ce7a5357ecb670a349cd5cf","finding_id":"arf_v1_cfehuxud4l7r6mcvojkkmoo6qo","finding_key":"sdk/offload/filesystem/filesystempayloadoffloader::previewconfig::serialized-view-confidentiality","identity_key":"sdk/offload/filesystem/filesystempayloadoffloader::previewconfig::serialized-view-confidentiality","line":492,"observation_digest":"80ca35c1316570fe35276c9e94bf020f3c0903b1dacf68b09fbd1f3f6adc1e42","observation_id":"aro_v1_qdfdlqjrmvyp4njhnspjjpycb4","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/offload/filesystem/FileSystemPayloadOffloader.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T09:35:44Z","review_id":"arr_v1_f7yfwsfn3t3ip6mxezvhkmn3pj","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"620892fae3e68f10de7e8a66278e9d7c5965ee5f","reviewer":"codex","start_line":490,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_ujin23i62rhnj6dck342euppj3"},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_ht6gwxp7pbfrvdvkb42otksrjl","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T09:35:44Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
